flowchart LR
 Commit --> Build[Build + SBOM + Provenance]
 Build --> Test[Unit / Integration / Contract / Security]
 Test --> Artifact[Immutable Artifact]
 Artifact --> Dev[Dev]
 Dev --> Stage[Staging]
 Stage --> Perf[Performance / Migration / E2E]
 Perf --> Approve[Release Approval]
 Approve --> Canary[Canary or Blue/Green]
 Canary --> Health{Health / SLO Pass?}
 Health -->|Yes| Prod[Production Promotion]
 Health -->|No| Rollback[Rollback / Halt]
 Prod --> Evidence[Release Evidence Bundle]
